## Installing the Chart

To install the draftt-explorer chart:

    helm install draftt-explorer draftt-io/draftt-explorer

To uninstall the chart:

    helm uninstall draftt-explorer

## Upgrading from 0.1.x

Version 2.0.0 replaces the legacy agent with the API-only Go agent.

Before upgrading, inspect the values explicitly stored with the release:

```bash
helm get values draftt-explorer -n <release-namespace>
```

Update explicit overrides as follows:

- Rename `cronjob.maxRetries` to `cronjob.backoffLimit`.
- Remove or update an explicit `image.tag: 0.0.1`.
- Remove `appConfig.localMode` and `appConfig.api.enabled`.

Upgrade using the new chart defaults plus the release's explicit values:

```bash
helm upgrade draftt-explorer draftt-io/draftt-explorer \
  --namespace <release-namespace> \
  --version 2.0.0 \
  --reset-then-reuse-values
```

